    <string name="welcome_step">step %1$d for %2$d</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">bluetooth access</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">android na tell one app which bluetooth device connect, and wetin dem call am, if the app get bluetooth access. na how ylih go know one pair of headphones from car stereo, and how am know one pair from another.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">with am: every pair go record from the moment dem connect, with nothing running and nothing to remember to press.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">without am: no bluetooth headphones go record at all. the rest of the app still work, and you fit grant am later for android’s app settings.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">notifications</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">detailed tracking run small background service, and android require any app wey do that to keep notification visible.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">with am: the notification go show wetin recording right now, which na the only sign detailed tracking dey alive.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_without">without am: detailed tracking still run and still record. android just no go show the notification.</string>
    <string name="hibernation_title">keep counting while you forget about am</string>
    <string name="hibernation_body">android go pause app wey no open for some months and take back their permissions, which go make ylih record nothing until you open am again. being forgot na exactly wetin this app for, so na good thing to turn that off now.</string>
