    <string name="settings_detailed_title">detailed tracking</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">e dey add wired headphone and playback time. android dey tell only app wey dey run about wire plug, so dis one dey keep quiet notification for di shade. bluetooth dey track anyhow.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">e no dey available until you give bluetooth access: dis build only dey declare connectedDevice service type, wey android 14+ tie to bluetooth permission.</string>
